9,Great Andamanese — Grokipedia,https://grokipedia.com/page/Great_Andamanese,"January 17, 2026 - The Great Andamanese are indigenous ... Aka-Bale, Aka-Cari, Aka-Jeru, Aka-Kede, Aka-Kol, Aka-Pucikwar, Oko-Juwoi, and others—each associated with mutually unintelligible dialects within the Great Andamanese language family.[4] British colonial incursions from the mid-19th century ...",Oko-Juwoi,Andamanese
